Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
Version: 1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre, devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-dmabuf
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Use the modesetting driver of XLibre on Intel and AMD GPUs
 X11 OutputClass section that selects the built-in modesetting driver
 for GPUs on the i915, xe and amdgpu kernel drivers, instead of the
 intel or amdgpu DDX. TearFree is enabled by default in the modesetting
 driver of XLibre.
